cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use this software or build on the ideas presented here, please cite
  both the software and the accompanying paper using the metadata below.

type: software
title: "NOX-Supermem"
abstract: >
  A persistent memory system for autonomous AI agent fleets implementing
  pain-weighted salience retrieval, shadow-mode ranking validation, and
  shared-canonical multi-agent context without federation overhead.
  Built on SQLite with FTS5, sqlite-vec, and Gemini embeddings.

